                "text": "Federal Budgets are moral documents. They tell the American people who we value, and who is left behind. This Budget is paid for by cutting healthcare, and food for working families and seniors. 40,000 across NW Ohio, and nearly 14 million nationwide will lose coverage for this Billionaire bonanza.",
