                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "11 Million people will lose health insurance. Over 7.8 Million will be kicked off Medicaid. More will lose coverage through the ACA. Families, seniors, kids\u2014all left with nothing, while Billionaires and big corporations pocket more $$. That\u2019s cruelty wrapped in fine print and packaged as \"reform.\u201d",
