                "text": "While Elon Musk and President Trump mark their territory, the GOP is working to kick 16 million people off their health care, collapse rural hospitals, and rack up more debt \u2014 all so Billionaires can receive massive tax breaks. It\u2019s time for them to grow up or get out of the way.",
