                "text": "I voted NO on the reckless rescission bill. Cancelling Elmo won\u2019t fix the cost-of-living crisis. Pulling the plug on PBS, NPR, and rural radio could mean no educational TV, cuts to emergency alerts and slashed local sports coverage. I stand with the American people who rely on voices they trust.",
