                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The stakes for NW Ohio couldn\u2019t be clearer. Nearly 30,000 people stand to lose care under the GOP\u2019s brutal health care cuts\u2014kids, workers, seniors. Rural hospitals\u2014already hanging on by a thread\u2014won\u2019t survive this. These cuts won\u2019t just close doors, it will cost lives\u2014we need to save our hospitals!",
