                "text": "GOP Senators are saying Ohio could face $8.4 Billion in Medicaid cuts. They know how bad this bill would be for states like ours. They need to stand up for Ohioans, not pass legislation that closes local hospitals and rips health care away from 700,000+ across the Buckeye State.",
