                "text": "Last summer, the @HouseGOP shut down work in mid-July instead of finding the big middle on bipartisan infrastructure reform.\n\nThis summer, with costs rising on everything from beef to health insurance premiums, they'd rather go home than tell the truth about Epstein. The American people sent us here to do hard work, not skip town early.",
