                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "1.6 Million veterans rely on Medicaid, and 600,000 more get coverage through the ACA. Most won\u2019t be exempt from new Medicaid work rules, and 267,000 could completely lose insurance when tax credits expire. Cutting these programs abandons veterans who served our nation. \n2 https://t.co/AbiJEcrmJC",
