                "reply_count": 11,
                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This week, I returned to Washington. As the government shutdown is into its 30th day the vast majority of my colleagues are not here. If Congress doesn't act, millions of Americans will see their health care premiums double or even triple, and 42 million Americans will lose critical food assistance.",
                "text_lang": "en",
